data-testid="post-byline-text__position">staff editor</span></span><span data-testid="post-byline-text--editor"><span>Reviewed by <!--[--><a href="/authors/yohan-yun" class="px-1 text-ct-ds-fg-default underline hover:decoration-ct-ds-accent-primary-default" data-testid="post-byline-text__name"><bdi>Yohan Yun</bdi></a><!--]--></span><span class="lowercase" data-testid="post-byline-text__position">staff editor</span></span></span></div><div class="hidden flex-wrap items-start gap-x-3 gap-y-2 desktop:flex"><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="ct-post-byline-avatar relative shrink-0 overflow-hidden rounded-full bg-ct-ds-bg-2 align-middle ring-1 ring-ct-ds-bg-default inline-block max-desktop:hidden" style="--post-byline-avatar-default:24px;--post-byline-avatar-tablet:24px;--post-byline-avatar-desktop:24px;" data-v-75aa44f9><img src="https://s3-images.ctmedia.io/media/author-images/author-1538-felix-ng.jpg" srcset="https://s3-images.ctmedia.io/media/author-images/author-1538-felix-ng-160x160.webp 160w, https://s3-images.ctmedia.io/media/author-images/author-1538-felix-ng-320x320.webp 320w" sizes="24px" alt width="24" height="24" loading="eager" decoding="async" class="size-full object-cover" data-testid="post-byline__image" data-v-75aa44f9><span class="absolute inset-0 rounded-full border border-ct-ds-border-clear" data-v-75aa44f9></span></span><span data-testid="post-byline-text"><span>Written by <!--[--><a href="/authors/felix-ng" class="px-1 text-ct-ds-fg-default underline hover:decoration-ct-ds-accent-primary-default" data-testid="post-byline-text__name"><bdi>Felix Ng</bdi></a><!--]--></span><span class="lowercase" data-testid="post-byline-text__position">staff editor</span></span></div><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="ct-post-byline-avatar relative shrink-0 overflow-hidden rounded-full bg-ct-ds-bg-2 align-middle ring-1 ring-ct-ds-bg-default inline-block max-desktop:hidden" style="--post-byline-avatar-default:24px;--post-byline-avatar-tablet:24px;--post-byline-avatar-desktop:24px;" data-v-75aa44f9><img src="https://s3-images.ctmedia.io/media/author-images/author-1985-yohan-yun.png" srcset="https://s3-images.ctmedia.io/media/author-images/author-1985-yohan-yun-160x160.webp 160w, https://s3-images.ctmedia.io/media/author-images/author-1985-yohan-yun-320x320.webp 320w" sizes="24px" alt width="24" height="24" loading="eager" decoding="async" class="size-full object-cover" data-v-75aa44f9><span class="absolute inset-0 rounded-full border border-ct-ds-border-clear" data-v-75aa44f9></span></span><span data-testid="post-byline-text--editor"><span>Reviewed by <!--[--><a href="/authors/yohan-yun" class="px-1 text-ct-ds-fg-default underline hover:decoration-ct-ds-accent-primary-default" data-testid="post-byline-text__name"><bdi>Yohan Yun</bdi></a><!--]--></span><span class="lowercase" data-testid="post-byline-text__position">staff editor</span></span></div></div></div><div class="flex flex-col items-start"><h1 class="pb-4 text-2xl/tight font-semibold tracking-tight text-pretty lang-aware-text text-ct-ds-fg-strong tablet:text-3xl desktop:text-[2.5rem]/12" data-testid="post__title">Grayscale files S-1 for first US Worldcoin ETF</h1><div class="flex flex-row flex-wrap items-start gap-2 text-xs tablet:gap-x-3 tablet:gap-y-2 tablet:text-sm" data-testid="post-article-meta"><a href="/category/latest-news" class="font-medium text-ct-ds-fg-default hover:underline" data-testid="post-article-meta__category">Latest News</a><span class="flex items-center gap-2 text-ct-ds-fg-muted tablet:gap-3"><span class="flex items-center gap-1 tablet:gap-1.5" data-testid="post-article-meta__publish-date"><span>Published</span><span>Jul 21, 2026</span></span><!----></span></div><p class="my-3 text-base/normal tracking-tight text-pretty lang-aware-text text-ct-ds-fg-default tablet:mt-5 tablet:mb-4 tablet:text-lg/normal" data-testid="post__description">The filing expands Grayscale’s growing lineup of crypto-related exchange-traded products outside of Bitcoin and Ether.</p></div><div data-testid="share-buttons--top" class="mb-3 flex min-h-8 flex-row flex-wrap gap-x-2 gap-y-1 select-none tablet:mb-4"><span></span></div><div class="@container max-tablet:-mx-5" data-testid="post-cover"><img src="https://s3-images.ctmedia.io/media/article-covers/worldcoin.jpg" srcset="https://s3-images.ctmedia.io/media/article-covers/worldcoin-320x213.webp 320w, https://s3-images.ctmedia.io/media/article-covers/worldcoin-480x320.webp 480w, https://s3-images.ctmedia.io/media/article-covers/worldcoin-640x426.webp 640w, https://s3-images.ctmedia.io/media/article-covers/worldcoin-960x640.webp 960w, https://s3-images.ctmedia.io/media/article-covers/worldcoin-1280x853.webp 1280w" sizes="(max-width: 768px) 360px, (max-width: 1024px) 728px, 896px" alt width="896" height="597" loading="eager" decoding="async" class="h-auto max-h-[calc(200cqw/3)] w-full object-cover tablet:rounded-lg" data-testid="post-cover__image"></div><!----><!--[--><div class="ct-prose mt-4 pb-10 tablet:mt-6 desktop:mt-8" data-testid="post__body"><p>Crypto asset manager Grayscale on Monday filed an S-1 registration statement for the first US Worldcoin ETF, which would give investors a way to gain exposure to the WLD token through an exchange-traded product. </p><p>According to the preliminary <a href="https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/2145351/000119312526308957/ck0002145351-20260720.htm" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank">prospectus</a>, the Grayscale Worldcoin ETF is intended to list on the Nasdaq under the symbol GWLD. </p><p>BitGo Bank &amp; Trust would custody the Worldcoin (WLD), while BNY Mellon would serve as administrator and transfer agent. CSC Delaware Trust Company would serve as a trustee. </p><p>The filing does not yet disclose details on management fees, seed investment, authorized participants or liquidity providers. </p><p><em><strong>Related: </strong></em><a href="https://cointelegraph.com/news/grayscale-eth-sol-staking-cash-payouts" target="_blank"><em><strong>Grayscale plans regular cash payouts from ETH, SOL staking rewards</strong></em></a></p><p>WLD is an ERC-20 token built on the Ethereum blockchain that serves as the native token of World, a project that uses biometric verification to distinguish humans from bots, which was founded by OpenAI CEO Sam Altman. </p><p>The proposed Worldcoin ETF adds to 17 crypto-related exchange-traded products offered by Grayscale, including those tracking Bitcoin (BTC), XRP (XRP), Solana (SOL), Ether (ETH), Dogecoin (DOGE) and Chainlink (LINK).</p></div><span></span><!--[--><!--v-if--><!--]--><!--]--><section aria-label="Newsletter subscription" class="flex w-full flex-col gap-5 border-y border-ct-ds-border-default bg-ct-ds-bg-1 py-5 tablet:flex-row tablet:items-center tablet:gap-6 dark:bg-transparent mb-8"><div class="flex items-center gap-4 tablet:flex-1"><div class="overflow-hidden bg-ct-ds-accent-primary-default h-[72px] w-[115px] shrink-0 rounded-lg"><img src="/assets/newsletters/1-min-letter.png" alt="1 minute letter" width="1024" height="640" loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full object-contain"></div><h3 class="text-lg font-semibold tracking-[-0.2px] text-ct-ds-fg-strong tablet:text-xl"> Subscribe to daily byte-sized crypto news from Cointelegraph </h3></div><a href="/newsletters/1-minute-letter" class="inline-flex justify-center items-center font-semibold transition focus:outline-none text-nowrap aria-disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:pointer-events-none cursor-pointer aria-disabled:cursor-default rounded-lg p-2 h-10 min-w-10 text-base aria-disabled:bg-ct-ds-bg-5 aria-disabled:text-ct-ds-fg-muted bg-ct-ds-accent-primary-default text-black dark:text-ct-ds-fg-inverted ui-not-selected:hover:bg-ct-ds-accent-primary-strong focus-visible:bg-ct-ds-accent-primary-strong aria-checked:bg-ct-ds-accent-primary-strong aria-pressed:bg-ct-ds-accent-primary-strong w-full tablet:w-auto tablet:shrink-0 tablet:px-8" rel="/newsletters/1-minute-letter