expands Grayscale’s growing lineup of crypto-related exchange-traded products outside of Bitcoin and Ether.\",\"slug\":\"grayscale-files-s-1-for-worldcoin-etf\",\"status\":\"published\",\"contentType\":\"editorial\",\"publishedAt\":\"2026-07-21T03:56:10.198Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-07-21T03:56:13.251Z\",\"noindex\":false,\"cover\":{\"url\":\"https:\u002F\u002Fs3-images.ctmedia.io\u002Fmedia\u002Farticle-covers\u002Fworldcoin.jpg\",\"alt\":null,\"width\":1450,\"height\":966,\"sizes\":{\"w320\":{\"url\":\"https:\u002F\u002Fs3-images.ctmedia.io\u002Fmedia\u002Farticle-covers\u002Fworldcoin-320x213.webp\",\"width\":320,\"__typename\":\"ArticleCover_Sizes_W320\"},\"w480\":{\"url\":\"https:\u002F\u002Fs3-images.ctmedia.io\u002Fmedia\u002Farticle-covers\u002Fworldcoin-480x320.webp\",\"width\":480,\"__typename\":\"ArticleCover_Sizes_W480\"},\"w640\":{\"url\":\"https:\u002F\u002Fs3-images.ctmedia.io\u002Fmedia\u002Farticle-covers\u002Fworldcoin-640x426.webp\",\"width\":640,\"__typename\":\"ArticleCover_Sizes_W640\"},\"w960\":{\"url\":\"https:\u002F\u002Fs3-images.ctmedia.io\u002Fmedia\u002Farticle-covers\u002Fworldcoin-960x640.webp\",\"width\":960,\"__typename\":\"ArticleCover_Sizes_W960\"},\"w1280\":{\"url\":\"https:\u002F\u002Fs3-images.ctmedia.io\u002Fmedia\u002Farticle-covers\u002Fworldcoin-1280x853.webp\",\"width\":1280,\"__typename\":\"ArticleCover_Sizes_W1280\"},\"w1920\":{\"url\":null,\"width\":null,\"__typename\":\"ArticleCover_Sizes_W1920\"},\"__typename\":\"ArticleCover_Sizes\"},\"__typename\":\"ArticleCover\"},\"author\":{\"id\":21,\"name\":\"Felix Ng\",\"slug\":\"felix-ng\",\"positionLabel\":\"Staff Editor\",\"noindexPosts\":false,\"cover\":{\"url\":\"https:\u002F\u002Fs3-images.ctmedia.io\u002Fmedia\u002Fauthor-images\u002Fauthor-1538-felix-ng.jpg\",\"alt\":\"Felix Ng\",\"width\":400,\"height\":400,\"sizes\":{\"w160\":{\"url\":\"https:\u002F\u002Fs3-images.ctmedia.io\u002Fmedia\u002Fauthor-images\u002Fauthor-1538-felix-ng-160x160.webp\",\"__typename\":\"AuthorImage_Sizes_W160\"},\"w320\":{\"url\":\"https:\u002F\u002Fs3-images.ctmedia.io\u002Fmedia\u002Fauthor-images\u002Fauthor-1538-felix-ng-320x320.webp\",\"__typename\":\"AuthorImage_Sizes_W320\"},\"w640\":{\"url\":null,\"__typename\":\"AuthorImage_Sizes_W640\"},\"__typename\":\"AuthorImage_Sizes\"},\"__typename\":\"AuthorImage\"},\"__typename\":\"Author\"},\"category\":{\"id\":1,\"name\":\"Latest News\",\"slug\":\"latest-news\",\"folder\":\"news\",\"__typename\":\"Category\"},\"subCategory\":{\"id\":89,\"name\":\"News Brief\",\"slug\":null,\"__typename\":\"Category\"},\"customAuthor\":null,\"__typename\":\"Article\",\"text\":{\"root\":{\"type\":\"root\",\"format\":\"\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"Crypto asset manager Grayscale on Monday filed an S-1 registration statement for the first US Worldcoin ETF, which would give investors a way to gain exposure to the WLD token through an exchange-traded product. \",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"According to the preliminary \",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1},{\"id\":\"6a5eec4f7c07672a2b9dfd76\",\"type\":\"link\",\"fields\":{\"url\":\"https:\u002F\u002Fwww.sec.gov\u002FArchives\u002Fedgar\u002Fdata\u002F2145351\u002F000119312526308957\u002Fck0002145351-20260720.htm\",\"newTab\":true,\"linkType\":\"custom\"},\"format\":\"\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":3,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"prospectus\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null},{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\", the Grayscale Worldcoin ETF is intended to list on the Nasdaq under the symbol GWLD. \",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"BitGo Bank & Trust would custody the Worldcoin (WLD), while BNY Mellon would serve as administrator and transfer agent. CSC Delaware Trust Company would serve as a trustee. \",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"The filing does not yet disclose details on management fees, seed investment, authorized participants or liquidity providers. \",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"Related: \",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":3,\"version\":1},{\"id\":\"6a5eed577c07672a2b9dfd79\",\"type\":\"link\",\"fields\":{\"url\":\"https:\u002F\u002Fcointelegraph.com\u002Fnews\u002Fgrayscale-eth-sol-staking-cash-payouts\",\"newTab\":true,\"linkType\":\"custom\"},\"format\":\"\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":3,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"Grayscale plans regular cash payouts from ETH, SOL staking rewards\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":3,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":3},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"WLD is an ERC-20 token built on the Ethereum blockchain that serves as the native token of World, a project that uses biometric verification to distinguish humans from bots, which was founded by OpenAI CEO Sam Altman. \",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"format\":\"\",\"indent\":0,\"version\":1,\"children\":[{\"mode\":\"normal\",\"text\":\"The proposed Worldcoin ETF adds to 17 crypto-related exchange-traded products offered by Grayscale, including those tracking Bitcoin (BTC), XRP (XRP), Solana (SOL), Ether (ETH), Dogecoin (DOGE) and Chainlink (LINK).\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":\"\",\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"textStyle\":\"\",\"textFormat\":0}],\"direction\":null}},\"metaTitle\":\"Grayscale Files S-1 for First US Worldcoin ETF\",\"metaDescription\":\"Grayscale has filed to launch the first US Worldcoin ETF on the Nasdaq, adding to its growing line up of crypto ETFs. \",\"topic\":{\"id\":25,\"slug\":\"altcoins\",\"title\":\"Altcoins\",\"__typename\":\"Tag\"},\"allTags\":[{\"id\":388,\"title\":\"Worldcoin\",\"slug\":\"worldcoin\",\"__typename\":\"Tag\"},{\"id\":655,\"title\":\"ETF\",\"slug\":\"etf\",\"__typename\":\"Tag\"},{\"id\":538,\"title\":\"Grayscale\",\"slug\":\"grayscale\",\"__typename\":\"Tag\"},{\"id\":25,\"title\":\"Altcoins\",\"slug\":\"altcoins\",\"__typename\":\"Tag\"}],\"sponsor\":null,\"editor\":{\"id\":29,\"name\":\"Yohan Yun\",\"slug\":\"yohan-yun\",\"positionLabel\":\"Staff Editor\",\"cover\":{\"url\":\"https:\u002F\u002Fs3-images.ctmedia.io\u002Fmedia\u002Fauthor-images\u002Fauthor-1985-yohan-yun.png\",\"sizes\":{\"w160\":{\"url\":\"https:\u002F\u002Fs3-images.ctmedia.io\u002Fmedia\u002Fauthor-images\u002Fauthor-1985-yohan-yun-160x160.webp\",\"__typename\":\"AuthorImage_Sizes_W160\"},\"w320\":{\"url\":\"https:\u002F\u002Fs3-images.ctmedia.io\u002Fmedia\u002Fauthor-images\u002Fauthor-1985-yohan-yun-320x320.webp\",\"__typename\":\"AuthorImage_Sizes_W320\"},\"w640\":{\"url\":null,\"__typename\":\"AuthorImage_Sizes_W640\"},\"__typename\":\"AuthorImage_Sizes\"},\"__typename\":\"AuthorImage\"},\"__typename\":\"Author\"}}],\"__typename\":\"Articles\"}}",{"hasNext":90,"da